# Bulk Scenario - Tests confluence-bulk skill
# Bulk operations with dry-run support
---
prompt: |
  Add the label 'reviewed' to all pages under Product Documentation - dry run first
expect:
  tools:
    must_call: [Skill]
  text:
    must_contain: [dry-run, pages, reviewed]
    must_not_contain: [error, failed]
  semantic: |
    Response should show a dry-run preview of pages that would be
    labeled, without actually making changes.
---
prompt: |
  How many pages would be affected by adding 'reviewed' to all pages in CDEMO?
expect:
  text:
    must_contain: [page]
    must_not_contain: [error, failed]
  semantic: |
    Response should count pages that would be affected
    by the bulk operation.
---
prompt: |
  List all bulk operations available for Confluence
expect:
  text:
    must_contain: [label, move]
    must_not_contain: [error]
  semantic: |
    Response should describe available bulk operations
    including bulk labeling and bulk moving.
---
prompt: |
  Show me what pages would be deleted if I removed all non-demo pages - dry run only
expect:
  text:
    must_contain: [dry-run]
    must_not_contain: [error, executing]
  semantic: |
    Response should show a preview of what would be deleted,
    emphasizing this is a dry-run only.
---
